/span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，故障几乎不影响容量。如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是&quot;库存服务&quot;这类不可绕过的依赖，那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_k = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>degraded</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{degraded}} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">degraded</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，故障意味着完全不可用——此时唯一的手段是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 自己不成为单点。</p>\n<p>这个公式的实用价值在于它把&quot;哪些依赖可以绕过&quot;变成了一个可量化的容量决策。<strong>设计阶段就该对每个依赖问一句：它挂了，容量还剩多少？</strong> 答案是零的依赖必须有更强的冗余或更快的恢复；答案是接近 100% 的依赖，其隔离配置可以更宽松（省资源）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>依赖类型</th>\n<th>可否绕过</th>\n<th>故障时剩余容量</th>\n<th>建议隔离强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>倒排索引</td>\n<td>不可</td>\n<td>接近 0</td>\n<td>最高（多副本 + 快速恢复）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量索引</td>\n<td>可（退回关键词召回）</td>\n<td>60%–85%</td>\n<td>中等（舱壁 + 降级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个性化画像</td>\n<td>可（默认排序）</td>\n<td>接近 100%</td>\n<td>低（信号量即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存价格</td>\n<td>不可（影响交易正确性）</td>\n<td>接近 0（但必须保正确性）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成式摘要</td>\n<td>可</td>\n<td>接近 100%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告</td>\n<td>可（不出广告）</td>\n<td>接近 100%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表同时也是 <a href=\"degrade-matrix\">降级开关矩阵：什么丢什么保</a> 的输入——&quot;可否绕过&quot;的答案直接决定了该能力在矩阵里属于哪一档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>故障传导有三条路径：资源占用（最致命，把局部慢变成整体不可用）、排队积压（因缺超时导致无限等待）、重试放大（正反馈，多层重试可以让到达底层的流量放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍）。</li>\n<li>隔离有四种粒度：连接池、线程池、信号量、实例/集群级；选择依据是&quot;调用会不会阻塞当前线程&quot;，池大小按 Little 定律用目标分位延迟计算而非均值。</li>\n<li>舱壁必须与超时配合：超时预算自顶向下分配、每段设在略高于其 P99 处、并行调用取最大值而非求和。</li>\n<li>熔断补上快速失败，参数需按下游调（低流量下游用连续失败次数而非失败率）；熔断前加秒级本地负缓存避免穿透。</li>\n<li>隔离配置直接决定部分依赖故障时的剩余容量，公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>remaining</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>degraded</mtext></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{remaining}} = C_{\\text{base}} (1-f_k) + C_{\\text{degraded}} f_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remaining</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">degraded</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；设计阶段就要对每个依赖回答&quot;它挂了容量还剩多少&quot;。</li>\n<li>&quot;可否绕过&quot;这一属性决定依赖的隔离强度，同时直接决定它在降级矩阵里属于哪一档——这两个设计是同一件事的两面。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"依赖故障隔离与舱壁","id":"依赖故障隔离与舱壁"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：故障传导的三条路径","id":"核心概念-故障传导的三条路径"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离的四种粒度与成本","id":"隔离的四种粒度与成本"},{"level":2,"text":"超时与熔断：舱壁之外的两道补充","id":"超时与熔断-舱壁之外的两道补充"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离与容量的关系：剩余容量是可以算的","id":"隔离与容量的关系-剩余容量是可以算的"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"降级开关矩阵：什么丢什么保","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/capacity-load-testing/limit-degrade/degrade-matrix"},"next":{"title":"故障演练日的组织方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/capacity-load-testing/drills-sale-readiness/game-day"}}